      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 The Institute of Psychology, Chinese Academy of Sciences and John Wiley & Sons Australia, Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "We investigated the effect of sex on associations between dark traits and time perspective dimensions. Responses by participants (N\u2009=\u2009338) to the Short Dark Triad Inventory and the Zimbardo Time Perspective Inventory showed that while sex was involved in different time perspective associations of Machiavellianism, psychopathy, and narcissism, it did not moderate the dark times' strategy."
      },
